# Everything that would either bloat the build context or leak into an image.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/TestResults/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Never in an image. appsettings.Development.json carries the local anonymity key
# and switches on the development seeder, which creates accounts with a published
# password.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.user
**/.env
**/*.pfx
**/*.key

**/logs/
**/uploads/
docs/
*.md
